your friends and block roaring flames. Call upon the spiritual essence of the world and empower your allies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Move Freely Through a Mystical Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624080/extras/7360a168b71bc22a559ad4e7b2787619.poster.avif?t=1767383620\" width=648 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624080/extras/7360a168b71bc22a559ad4e7b2787619.webm?t=1767383620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Jump, air-dash, and mantle over obstacles. Hone your platforming skill and discover new pathways across stony cliffs, burning magma, noxious mangroves, and spore riddled chasms.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Sandy Dingo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624080/header.jpg?t=1767383620","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2624080/1067019619/03c5d4ac0ade6d2015fe06a790dd1066e09d84a1/1752980774/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753030055","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2624080/1067019619/03c5d4ac0ade6d2015fe06a790dd1066e09d84a1/1752980774/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753030055","highlight":true,"hls_h264":